  "steps": [
    "Add Chopped garlic to 1 tsp of oil. When its becomes a little brown, add in all the veggies except for tomato.",
    "Keep the veggies a little crunchy and don’t make it mushy. Only cook for 6-7 minutes.",
    "Add the sauces mentioned above along with the spices mentioned.",
    "Give it a mix, add ik the basil and paneer ( I have roasted the paneer until brown on all sides on a non stick pan in 1 tsp oil)",
    "Let it cook for another 5 minutes and once your salad cools down, add the chilled mango salsa along with roasted peanuts.",
    "Toss your salad and then enjoy!"
